{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日昼は\nベルに立候補して\n10役は無理だったけど\nエリザベートできました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1幕の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"公演日報にもあるひめたんの\n「てっぱん、すみび、ひめたんビーム！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「それは肉じゃなくて中田の心がやけます」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言えば良かったな～と後悔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、これ、\nすべるかな？w"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーでも\nひめたんとできて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/15/9744762/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2幕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリザベートは3回目でした(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1回目と2回目とも\nまたちょっと違うエリザベートをやりました(・∀・)ぺろぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、夜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜もベルに立候補しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとなんと\n立候補が一人だけとゆー\nラッキーガールになれました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/06/15/9744762/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラッキーガールって本当に幸せだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に良かった(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベルは初日ぶりだったけど\n一番練習してた役だから\n千秋楽までにもう一回できて良かった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/k